# Sample Resume File

This is a placeholder resume file. In a real implementation, you would place your actual resume files here:

- John_Doe_Resume.pdf
- John_Doe_Resume.docx

These files would be accessible via:
- /John_Doe_Resume.pdf
- /John_Doe_Resume.docx

Make sure to update the file paths in ResumeContent.jsx to match your actual file locations.